  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(x)/(2y) = (6)/(7)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(x)/(2y) = (6)/(7)\n\nBy cross multiplication, we get \n\n⇒ 7x = 12y \n\n⇒ x/y = 12/7 \n\nNow,(x - y)/(x + y) + (14)/(19)\n\n⇒ (12 - 7)/(12 + 7) + 14/19 \n\n⇒ 5/19 + 14/19 \n\n⇒ 19/19 or 1 \n\n**∴ The required value is 19/19.**",
